           "message": "Orbital 'A' has no pages defined - traits won't be accessible",
           "suggestion": "Add a pages array with at least one page to expose the orbital's traits",
           "severity": "error"
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     "trait": "OrbLintOrbitalMissingPages"
    }
   ]
